ed to kill criminals that the mundane law was unable to bring to justice, the Martial Fist now set their sights on Tatsuma Hiyuu, Kyouichi Houraiji, Aoi Misato, Komaki Sakurai, Yuuya Daigo, and Hisui Kisaragi.\n\nWhat is the purpose of this cruel turn of events? And who ordered the hit? New threats emerge as others awakened to powers unleashed by the Ryumyaku seek out the Magami kids - and old friends now return as enemies.\n\nDestinies will collide as the Stars of Fate begin to merge; Yin and Yang will meet. And soon the shadowy figure pulling the strings will reveal himself, in an effort to raze Tokyo to the ground and awaken the Vessel of the Golden Dragon."},"tags":[{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Tokyo Majin Season 2","english":"Tokyo Majin Season 2","native":"東京魔人學園剣風帖　龖（トウ） 第弐幕","romaji":"Tokyo Majin Gakuen Kenpucho: Tou Dai Ni Maku","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"東京魔人學園剣風帖 龖 第弐幕"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"东京魔人学园剑风帖 龙龙 第二幕"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}